{"5055800":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Verdreamia","steam_appid":5055800,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5286340],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >a quiet place to grow<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verdreamia is a gardening game with no fail states, no timers, and nothing to defend while away, only tend when you're there. Neglect a dream for a month and it waits for you, a little sleepy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >plant a dream anywhere<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twelve places to begin: rolling meadow, mountain meadow, verdant field, river valley, mystic dune, tropical shore, raised beds, greenhouse, a Victorian conservatory, a great room, a blank canvas, and a garden of pods drifting past a window of stars. Thirty plus species, from daisies and foxgloves to moonbells that only glow after dark.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >every plant is grown, not placed<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants are not prefab. Each specimen is generated from a seed and its own history of care, so no two are alike and yours regrow exactly as they were on any machine, forever.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >paint what you love<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame any view and it becomes a painting on your gallery wall. That gallery is the room you return to, and the record of what your gardens looked like on the days you loved them most. Eight art styles restyle a whole dream at once, from impressionism to old masters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >two worlds to dream in<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dream grows in one of two worlds, and you can move it between them whenever you like. Golden hush grows soft, rounded shapes in long honey light, and its blooms glow like small lanterns as the day fades. Classic is the uncanny garden of our dreams. Each art style can be applied to enhance the gallery framing of your dream.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >the journal remembers<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet joys instead of quests. Press a flourishing bloom to keep its cultivar, and the journal fills with what you noticed rather than what you completed. Send a postcard of a painting to a friend; the whole dream travels inside the picture, and they can walk through it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >and it is always the right time<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generative music with its own feel. Rain on greenhouse panes. A sun you can pin where you like it.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >a quiet place to grow<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verdreamia is a gardening game with no fail states, no timers, and nothing to defend while away, only tend when you're there. Neglect a dream for a month and it waits for you, a little sleepy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >plant a dream anywhere<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twelve places to begin: rolling meadow, mountain meadow, verdant field, river valley, mystic dune, tropical shore, raised beds, greenhouse, a Victorian conservatory, a great room, a blank canvas, and a garden of pods drifting past a window of stars. Thirty plus species, from daisies and foxgloves to moonbells that only glow after dark.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >every plant is grown, not placed<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants are not prefab. Each specimen is generated from a seed and its own history of care, so no two are alike and yours regrow exactly as they were on any machine, forever.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >paint what you love<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame any view and it becomes a painting on your gallery wall. That gallery is the room you return to, and the record of what your gardens looked like on the days you loved them most. Eight art styles restyle a whole dream at once, from impressionism to old masters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >two worlds to dream in<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dream grows in one of two worlds, and you can move it between them whenever you like. Golden hush grows soft, rounded shapes in long honey light, and its blooms glow like small lanterns as the day fades. Classic is the uncanny garden of our dreams. Each art style can be applied to enhance the gallery framing of your dream.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >the journal remembers<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet joys instead of quests. Press a flourishing bloom to keep its cultivar, and the journal fills with what you noticed rather than what you completed. Send a postcard of a painting to a friend; the whole dream travels inside the picture, and they can walk through it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >and it is always the right time<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generative music with its own feel. Rain on greenhouse panes. A sun you can pin where you like it.<\/p>","short_description":"A cozy gardening sim where you create the gardens of your dreams. Plant dreams in twelve places: a meadow, a conservatory, a window of stars. Tend them at your own pace, in your favorite world style, and frame the views you love into your gallery.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5055800\/086beae87453ad0acf591c15780718863376cd96\/header.jpg?t=1793746204","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5055800\/48b1ff65b79b525694b012c6f790e4c163eaea2a\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793746204","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5055800\/48b1ff65b79b525694b012c6f790e4c163eaea2a\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793746204","website":"https:\/\/verdreamia.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 1809 or later)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual core, 2.0 GHz (Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 capable GPU with WebGL 2 support (Intel HD 4400 or newer)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Runs comfortably on integrated graphics. 1280x720 display or larger.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad core, 2.5 GHz (Intel Core i5-8250U or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 12 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel Iris Xe, GeForce GTX 1050, or better<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1, or Intel Core i5 (2015 or later)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal capable (any Mac that can run macOS 11)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Runs comfortably on integrated graphics. 1280x720 display or larger.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 13 Ventura or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 12 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["AtomicBorg Inc.","https:\/\/atomicborg.com\/"],"publishers":["AtomicBorg Inc.","https:\/\/atomicborg.com\/"],"demos":[{"appid":5286340,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1199,"final":959,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$11.99","final_formatted":"$9.59"},"packages":[1752602],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Verdreamia","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1752602,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Verdreamia - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$11.99<\/span> $9.59","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":959}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5055800\/5e021a895c60d5ab2d2709f9aea9bea7d2b910fb\/ss_5e021a895c60d5ab2d2709f9aea9bea7d2b910fb.600x338.jpg?t=1793746204","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5055800\/5e021a895c60d5ab2d2709f9aea9